[White "Find the Unexpected Blow!"]
[Black "Introduction: Find the Unexpected Blow!"]
[Result "*"]

1. --
{ @@HeaderStart@@Find the unexpected blow!@@HeaderEnd@@  In this chapter, you must find unexpected incisive moves! Sacrifices, intermediate moves, surprising and hidden moves will be on the menu.   The aim of this chapter is to help you to understand how rich chess is in ideas, so that you can overcome your bad automatic reflexes. Everyone is able to spot basic things. You have to force yourself to see the rest!  The difficulty of the exercises in this chapter ranges from medium to difficult. }
*

