[Black "Introduction: Play the Killer Positional Move!"]
[Result "*"]

{ @@HeaderStart@@Play the killer positional move!@@HeaderEnd@@  In this chapter, you must find strong positional moves. The solution is always concrete and the evaluation of the position which will result should be very helpful.  A good positional move does not mean there are no tactics involved! On the contrary, this series of exercises is intended to help you to intelligently mix tactics and strategy.  The difficulty of these exercises ranges from medium to difficult, the most challenging ones being marked with an asterisk. }
